al"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chauvineau</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Codine</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>H&#x000e9;risson</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Pellas</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>P&#x000e9;lissier</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>What is the place of diphosphonates in the treatment of complex regional pain syndrome I?</article-title><source>Ann Readapt Med Phys</source><year>2005</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>150</fpage><lpage>157</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15833263</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>